---

# Automation Feedback

Automatic actions should be visible but unobtrusive.

Example

Good Night activated.

Small banner.

No modal.

---

# Navigation

Navigation should always indicate hierarchy.

Push

Slides horizontally.

Modal

Slides vertically.

Dismiss

Returns naturally.

Never invent transitions.

---

# Search

Results begin appearing after the first character.

Animation

Fade

↓

Expand

↓

Highlight

No search button required.

---

# Selection

Selecting an item should update immediately.

Never require confirmation for non-destructive actions.

---

# Toggle Behavior

Touch

↓

Immediate thumb movement

↓

Color transition

↓

Haptic

↓

Updated state

Never delay toggle animations.

---

# Sliders

Used for

Volume

Brightness

Temperature

Rules

Continuous updates

Gentle haptic detents

Smooth interpolation

Never jump.

---

# Lists

Rows highlight immediately.

Selection fades naturally.

Swipe actions follow native iOS behavior.

---

# Context Menus

Appear instantly.

Blur background.

Scale animation.

Dismiss with tap outside.

---

# Sheets

Presentation

Spring animation.

Dismiss

Drag

Swipe

Close button

All supported.

---

# Errors

Errors never interrupt unless necessary.

Preferred

Inline message

↓

Banner

↓

Sheet

↓

Full screen

Only critical failures deserve full-screen interruption.

---

# Empty States

Should encourage action.

Example

"No automations yet.

Create your first automation."

Never display:

"No Data"

---

# Recovery

Every failed interaction should offer a clear recovery.

Retry

Reconnect

Diagnostics

Help

Never leave users without an action.

